# TURN relay (ExpressTURN, free plan): lets phones on any network (mobile data, other Wi-Fi)
# reach the table when a direct connection isn't possible. These values end up in the site's
# code anyway (the browser needs them), so they are not secret; they only work with this
# account's free quota. To change them: expressturn.com → Dashboard → Refresh Credentials.
